            "ev:e8a087ffa46b15f2ef846089f3d695939d20668fa30336c7c1f36c552861d4c0"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/database-tools/mongoexport.md",
            "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo-tools/blob/master/mongoexport/mongoexport.go"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mongoimport CSV parsing follows RFC-4180: backslashes are not escape characters, and a double quote inside a quoted field must be escaped with another double quote. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/database-tools/mongoimport.md",
          "note": null,
